= Sustainability Challenges

== Customers privacy and data
Telia is responsible of handling it's customer data and privacy, ensuring that customer private data doesn't end up in unauthorized
hands. In 2025 over 8000 thousand cyber attacks were analyzed according to European Union Agency for Cybersecurity (ENISA, 2026), 
where 73% of attacks where targeted towards NIS2 (network and information) same factor that Telia operates in. Because Telia handles personal
information on it's customers such as billing information, home address, identification data, Telia requires strong security otherwise
it risk of losing sensitive information of it's customers and their trust, and could end up getting fined by GDPR and Sweden's 
supplementary data protection law (2018:218). Making the protection more important than ever. Resulting in protection of Telia's customers more important than ever.


