= Sustainability Work of the Company


== Privacy data Point...

Telia protects customers data and personal information collected by Telia services in various ways to follow the GDPR and Sweden's supplementary data protection law. Telia employees are under professional secrecy, educated in data security and accountable to follow through with their duty to protect user privacy and data. Companies that work with Telia are also obligated that their employees follow strict guide lines that align with the law such as GDPR and Sweden's supplementary data protection law in order to protect user data and privacy. \
Telia only keep personal information stored as long as necessary connected to the maximal length data is allowed to be stored. This ensures that sensitive information gets deleted and decreases information gathered from breaches. For example information regarding ip-addresses are only stored up to 10 days, 0 months for transmitting calls, sms and also 0 months to perform credit check (Telia Sverige AB, 2026). \
Telia defends it's infrastructure, cyber attacks through firewalls, anti ddos system, and by monitoring network traffic and scan for abnormal behavior to prevent attacks in real time.

